ry."]="全选后按 Ctrl+C 复制此报告。日志将返回事件历史。",["Select Link"]="选择链接",["Select Report"]="选择报告",["Send Invitation"]="发送邀请",["Send and show announcements when players start looking for questing partners. Their status and glowing icons remain visible when this is off."]="当玩家开始寻找任务伙伴时发送和显示通知。关闭此选项后，仍会显示他们的状态和发光图标。",["Send your enabled event announcements to party chat when a member has not been recognized as a QuestTogether user. Also announce requests to join when you cannot invite and the party leader is not known to use QT. Everyone in the party sees these messages. Does not post to raids."]="当某个成员未被识别为 QuestTogether 用户时，将你已启用的事件通告发送到小队聊天。当你无法邀请且不知道小队队长是否使用 QT 时，也会通告加入请求。小队中的所有人都能看到这些消息。不会发送到团队。",["Separate Chat Window"]="独立聊天窗口",["Settings"]="设置",["Settings API is unavailable; addon options could not be registered."]="设置 API 不可用；无法注册插件选项。",["Settings API is unavailable; unable to open options."]="设置 API 不可用；无法打开选项。",["Share"]="分享",["Share attempted"]="已尝试分享",["Share attempted. WoW checks each player's eligibility."]="已尝试分享。WoW 会检查每位玩家的资格。",["Share my focused quest"]="共享我的重点追踪任务",["Share my location"]="分享我的位置",["Share my location on the map and minimap"]="在地图和小地图上分享我的位置",["Share my waypoint"]="共享我的路径点",["Share this quest with your party."]="将此任务分享给你的小队。",["Share updates with your party?"]="与队伍分享进度？",["Shareable"]="可共享",["Sharing unavailable"]="分享不可用",["Show Announcements For"]="显示通告范围",["Show Chat Bubbles"]="显示聊天气泡",["Show Chat Logs"]="显示聊天记录",["Show QuestTogether Chat"]="显示 QuestTogether 聊天",["Show a quest icon on default Blizzard nameplates when a unit is a quest objective."]="当单位是任务目标时，在默认 Blizzard 姓名板上显示任务图标。",["Show an announcement when a player abandons or removes a quest."]="玩家放弃或移除任务时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player accepts a quest."]="玩家接受任务时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player enters a bonus objective area."]="玩家进入奖励目标区域时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player enters a world quest area."]="玩家进入世界任务区域时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player finishes a bonus objective."]="玩家完成奖励目标时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player finishes a world quest."]="玩家完成世界任务时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player leaves a bonus objective area."]="玩家离开奖励目标区域时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player leaves a world quest area."]="玩家离开世界任务区域时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when a player turns in a completed quest."]="玩家交付已完成的任务时显示通知。",["Show an announcement when all quest objectives are done and the quest is ready to turn in."]="所有任务目标均已完成且任务可以交付时显示通知。",["Show conversations from the QuestTogether channel in enabled chat logs and bubbles. Quest announcements are unaffected."]="在已启用的聊天记录和聊天气泡中显示 QuestTogether 频道的对话。不影响任务通知。",["Show minimap icon"]="显示小地图图标",["Show other players on the map and minimap"]="在地图和小地图上显示其他玩家",["Show party waypoints"]="显示小队路径点",["Show player locations"]="显示玩家位置",["Show progress for"]="显示进度：",["Show progress updates for bonus objectives."]="显示奖励目标的进度更新。",["Show progress updates for world quest objectives."]="显示世界任务目标的进度更新。",["Show shared player locations on the world map and nearby players on the minimap."]="在世界地图上显示共享的玩家位置，并在小地图上显示附近玩家。",["Show that you're looking for questing partners. Turning this on announces your search throughout your zone when location sharing is enabled. Saved per profile; toggle with /qt lfg."]="表明你正在寻找任务伙伴。开启此选项时，如果已启用位置共享，就会在你所在的整个区域发布寻找伙伴的通知。按配置文件保存；使用 /qt lfg 切换。",["Show the QuestTogether logo beside friendly players who are using QuestTogether."]="在使用 QuestTogether 的友方玩家旁显示 QuestTogether 标志。",["Show the QuestTogether minimap menu. Drag the button to move it around the minimap."]="显示 QuestTogether 小地图菜单。拖动按钮可在小地图周围移动。",["Show updates as players make progress on quest objectives, such as collecting items or defeating enemies."]="显示玩家的任务目标进度，例如收集物品或击败敌人。",["Show your party's shared pins on the world map and nearby on the minimap. Receiving a pin never changes your navigation."]="在世界地图上显示小队共享的标记，并在小地图上显示附近的标记。收到标记不会改变你的导航。",["Snapshot received"]="已收到快照",["Snapshot unavailable"]="快照不可用",["Solo"]="单人",["Someone is missing the quest"]="有人没有此任务",["Someone is ready"]="有人已完成",["Stop following"]="停止跟随",["Stop looking for partners when joining a group"]="加入队伍时停止寻找伙伴",["Switch this character to another profile."]="将此角色切换到另一个配置文件。",["Switch, copy, create, reset, or delete saved settings profiles."]="切换、复制、创建、重置或删除已保存的设置配置文件。",["Target a nearby player or provide a visible player name."]="选中附近玩家为目标，或提供一个可见的玩家名称。",["Test summary: %d passed, %d failed (%d total)."]="测试摘要：%d 通过，%d 失败（共 %d）。",["The local preview was suppressed by your announcement settings."]="本地预览已被你的通告设置隐藏。",["These notes are available in English only."]="这些说明仅提供英文版本。",["This command only changes on/off settings."]="此命令只能更改开关类设置。",["This player cannot currently accept join requests. Try whispering them."]="该玩家当前无法接受加入请求。试着密语他们。",["This player cannot currently invite you."]="该玩家当前无法邀请你。",["This player is using QuestTogether"]="该玩家正在使用 QuestTogether",["This quest cannot be shared."]="该任务无法共享。",["This quest is not available in your quest log."]="此任务在你的任务日志中不可用。",["This quest is not in your quest log."]="该任务不在你的任务日志中。",["Tint quest-objective nameplate health bars with your selected quest color."]="用你选择的任务颜色为任务目标姓名板生命条着色。",["Tips"]="提示",["Toggle Party Quest Log"]="切换队伍任务日志",["Top"]="顶部",["Troubleshooting"]="故障排除",["Turn off Looking for Questing Partners when you join or form a party or raid. You can turn it back on to recruit more players."]="加入或组建小队或团队时关闭寻找任务伙伴。你可以重新开启以招募更多玩家。",["Turn off announcements"]="关闭公告",["Unable to build a test announcement for that player."]="无法为该玩家生成测试通告。",["Unable to build a test announcement from your target."]="无法从你的目标生成测试通告。",["Unable to open patch notes right now."]="现在无法打开补丁说明。",["Unable to open that quest in your quest log."]="无法在你的任务日志中打开该任务。",["Unable to open your quest log on this client."]="无法在此客户端打开你的任务日志。",["Unable to send QuestTogether chat. The addon must be enabled and its chat channel available."]="无法发送 QuestTogether 聊天消息。必须启用插件且聊天频道可用。",